                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The idea of free-form exploration with a \"show, don't tell\" approach reminds me of Yume Nikki. I know some reviewers mentioned Knytt and FEZ as similar games, but I have never played any of those. It's not exactly my cup of tea, and I think there isn't enough depth to the world-building or atmosphere, but it could be just me.\n\nP.S. This is a \"neutral\" review, I chose \"recommended\" because Steam doesn't offer that option.",
